    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a feeling though. it's like there's no substance behind it. i spend all day looking at pixels, talking to people through glass, and it feels like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. if i'm just a glitch or an error, what's even the point of trying to fix it? if the code is broken, you don't patch it, you just stop the process.",
